#   (d) Folder visibility enforced server-side.
#   (e) vault_access_log is INSERT-only. No UPDATE or DELETE from application layer.


# SECTION 4: FRONTEND CONVENTIONS

## DOMAIN SEPARATION
#   - Employee and Employer are completely separate domains.
#   - They do not share Zustand slices, components, or routes.

## COMPONENT QUALITY
